<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bob CodeLab | Learn to Code</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #0b1120;
            color: white;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: #111c33;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero span {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #0284c7;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #0369a1;
        }

        section {
            padding: 60px 8%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        section h2 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #17243b;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            width: 250px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        #about p {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: auto;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        footer {
            background: #111c33;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 5px;
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 34px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">Bob CodeLab</div>

        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>Welcome to <span>Bob CodeLab</span></h1>

        <p>
            Learn. Build. Create.
            Discover the world of web development
            and turn your ideas into reality.
        </p>

        <a href="#skills" class="btn">Explore My Skills</a>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Bob CodeLab</h2>

        <p>
            Bob CodeLab is a place dedicated to learning
            programming, developing websites and exploring
            technology. Join me on my journey as I learn
            to become a professional web developer.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="skills">
        <h2>What I Am Learning</h2>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <h3>HTML</h3>
                <p>Learning how to build the structure
                of beautiful websites.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>CSS</h3>
                <p>Learning how to design and style
                modern websites.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>JavaScript</h3>
                <p>Learning how to make websites
                interactive and dynamic.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Me</h2>

        <p>Have a question? Let's connect!</p>

        <br>

        <a href="mailto:bobcodelab@gmail.com" class="btn">
            Send Me an Email
        </a>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Bob CodeLab. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>Learn. Build. Create.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
.html
